<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>I'd Rather Die</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="group" xml:id="v1">THE DRIVER ERA, Ross Lynch, Rocky</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">I'd Rather Die</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">2zrkzByBpURasLLPrSwXH2</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:00.690" end="00:02.520">I shouldn't drive</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:02.520" end="00:04.020">i'm way too high</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:03.660" end="00:05.160">can't get enough</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:04.530" end="00:07.830">not what it seems</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:07.830" end="00:09.330">or can I be</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:09.150" end="00:12.060">am I in love?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:12.060" end="00:13.560">i'm on my knees</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:13.230" end="00:14.730">i'm begging please</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:14.490" end="00:15.990">can't give you up</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:15.210" end="00:16.710">tonight</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:16.020" end="00:19.110">tonight</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:19.110" end="00:26.580">tomorrow</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:26.580" end="00:31.890">i'll do it tomorrow</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:31.890" end="00:34.740">I know i've said this before</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:34.740" end="00:37.170">about a thousand times</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.170" end="00:39.750">I try my best to be good</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.750" end="00:42.660">but I live for the night</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.660" end="00:46.410">baby can't you see</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.410" end="00:51.090">I got everything that I need</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.090" end="00:53.130">but if I can't have you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.130" end="00:54.630">i'd rather die</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.640" end="01:01.640">i'd rather die</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:01.920" end="01:03.840">if I can't have you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:03.840" end="01:10.020">i'd rather die</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.020" end="01:15.480">i'd rather die</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:15.480" end="01:17.700">i've been losing my balance</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:17.700" end="01:20.700">my balance my balance</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:20.700" end="01:23.070">keep on keeping these habits</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:23.070" end="01:24.570">these habits</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:24.390" end="01:25.890">its tragic</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:25.470" end="01:28.410">bitch don't kill my vibe</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:28.410" end="01:30.690">cause this shit is paradise</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:30.690" end="01:32.190">you gotta keep it up</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:31.740" end="01:33.240">make me feel alright</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:32.940" end="01:34.440">feel alright</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:34.260" end="01:36.000">feel alright</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:36.000" end="01:38.730">I know i've said this before</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:38.730" end="01:41.190">about a thousand times</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:41.190" end="01:43.770">I try my best to be good</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:43.770" end="01:46.650">but I live for the night</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:46.650" end="01:50.100">baby can't you see</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:50.100" end="01:55.110">I got everything that I need</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:55.110" end="01:57.120">but if I can't have you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:57.120" end="01:58.620">i'd rather die</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:57.660" end="02:05.660">i'd rather die</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:05.940" end="02:08.220">if I can't have you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:08.220" end="02:13.110">i'd rather die</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:13.110" end="02:17.110">i'd rather die</p></div></body></tt>